# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository *and* in the working tree.
# This project is edited from both Windows and WSL; with core.autocrlf=true the
# checkout would be CRLF while the index stays LF, which makes every file show
# up as modified after switching environments.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Keep binaries byte-exact.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
